{"toc":[{"t":"Title page","c":0},{"t":"Foreword","c":0},{"t":"Celebration 1","c":0,"s":"“Hear, O Israel”"},{"t":"Celebration 2","c":0,"s":"Listen, my son"},{"t":"Celebration 3","c":0,"s":"Blessed are we… what pleases God has been revealed to us"},{"t":"Celebration 4","c":0,"s":"The Lord gave, the Lord has taken away"},{"t":"Celebration 5","c":0,"s":"Wisdom makes her people glorious, does not neglect them, assisting them at all times and in every place"},{"t":"Retreat 1","c":0,"s":"“Not everything is vanity”"},{"t":"Celebration 6","c":0,"s":"“They do not know what they are doing”"},{"t":"Celebration 7","c":0,"s":"“I thirst!”"},{"t":"Celebration 8","c":0,"s":"“God himself will provide the lamb”"},{"t":"Celebration 9","c":0,"s":"“I have earnestly desired to eat this Passover with you before I suffer”"},{"t":"Celebration 10","c":0,"s":"“Can these bones live?”"},{"t":"Retreat 2","c":0,"s":"The silence of Jesus"},{"t":"Celebration 11","c":0,"s":"“Destroy this temple”"},{"t":"Celebration 12","c":0,"s":"“If Christ has not been raised, your faith is futile”"},{"t":"Celebration 13","c":0,"s":"“The blood of Jesus cleanses us from all sin”"},{"t":"Celebration 14","c":0,"s":"“Holy and blameless before him”"},{"t":"Celebration 15","c":0,"s":"“I am Jesus, whom you are persecuting”"},{"t":"Retreat 3","c":0,"s":"Jesus spoke of the Kingdom of God"},{"t":"Celebration 16","c":0,"s":"“Christ suffered for us”"},{"t":"Celebration 17","c":0,"s":"“They will see a thing never told to them…”"},{"t":"Celebration 18","c":0,"s":"“We have seen his Glory”"},{"t":"Celebration 19","c":0,"s":"“The love of Christ urges us on”"},{"t":"Celebration 20","c":0,"s":"“Let it be known, therefore, with certainty”"},{"t":"Retreat 4","c":0,"s":"Chosen for a divine mission"},{"t":"Celebration 21","c":0,"s":"“We await being clothed with power”"},{"t":"Celebration 22","c":0,"s":"“O God, give me justice”"},{"t":"Celebration 23","c":0,"s":"“Jesus of Nazareth passed among us, loving us”"},{"t":"Celebration 24","c":0,"